From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bernardo Pereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:55:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Paint background-clip: text on inline roots and inline spans

Background layers with `background-clip: text` were skipped by the background
painter, so gradient headings with `color: transparent` or
`-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent` painted invisible.

Paint text-clipped background layers inside an isolated layer masked with
opaque glyph silhouettes via `Compose::DestIn`, both for inline roots and for
inline descendant spans.
---
